rs** inspecting a world before/during connection: granted (requested) set, derived used set, and how both changed since their last connection (feeds the change-notice design under #5955).\n- **World authors:** their own worlds' requested-vs-used diffs, library footprints they inherit, uncertified-derivation markings (sibling exception-policy follow-up under #5955).\n- **Server admins:** server-side capability grants in force, per-world capability inventory, moderation-pack provenance (which pack, which version, which feeds — sibling moderation follow-ups under #5955).\n- History: capability diffs over time are registry facts, queryable — not just a current-state view.\n\n## Done looks like\n\nAn audience×surface matrix with the concrete views each audience gets, specified against the registry schema from #5958.\n","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6017/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/